cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference this design record, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "VideoFusion-Web"
abstract: >-
  Architecture and implementation notes for projecting live UAV video streams
  onto 3D reality-mesh (oblique photogrammetry) scenes. Covers camera pose and
  FOV alignment, ESVideoFusion binding, single-active-stream state management,
  screen-space connector synchronisation, and a local HLS streaming setup built
  on Node Media Server plus ffmpeg. Documentation only; no runnable source code.
